# Authors

## Packaging and AVD/PIV integration
**Stephen Trotter** — GitHub: [sjtrotter](https://github.com/sjtrotter), COPR: ki3den
Maintainer of `remmina-plugins-rdp-avd`: the packaging (RPM specs, build scripts,
CI) and the Azure Virtual Desktop / Entra (AAD) authentication and smart-card
(PIV) web sign-in integration in `patches/`.

