## Remmina
Remmina — The GTK Remote Desktop Client — is the work of the Remmina project and
its contributors (Vic Lee; Marc-André Moreau; Antenore Gatta; Giovanni Panozzo;
and many others). See LICENSE for the full upstream copyright notices. This
repository packages a Remmina snapshot and a modified RDP plugin derived from it,
distributed under the same GPL-2.0-or-later license with the OpenSSL exception.
